  "$comment": "Campaign level 40 (chapter 4, The Wild Heart): an archipelago. Home isle west, a small outer isle with a dormant seer stone in the storm lane, the rival turtle on the far isle east, and a small aggressive raider tribe on a sheer sea stack to the north (aboveSea 340, falloff 12: no shore within the snap radius, so no boat lands there and the raiders live until their stage). Stages: raise a Boathouse (wakes the seer; until then a band of four lands every 120 s from 300 s), ferry five and pray 50 s while a neutral whirlwind sweeps the seer isle and two lightning strikes hit the lane every 110 s (after 0, until 3, warned 10 s ahead), kill sixteen raiders who land north and south every 140 s, then burn the rival Hearth (rival maxTroops 10, four wardens join, smaller north raids every 150 s). Hard bot offset 1 wins at tick 27712 (stages done at 705, 3315, 11365); offsets 2 and 3 win at 18522 and 19974. Time limit 2820 s (56400 ticks, over 2x the bot).",
